{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:46 2026-10-05 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:46 2026-10-05 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:46 2026-10-05 HKT</p><p>葵涌國瑞路88號一工地，今（5日）早上11時21分，警方接獲多個報案指，工地有電線冒出火花，並不時傳出爆炸聲響，擔心影響行經途人安全。警方接報到場，圍封附近50米範圍，消防到場戒備，正了解事件。</p><img alt=\"警員到場封路。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f175a5963d2cbab977bd90d83719c010/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_13_35_42.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b2e8c2f678f381be2f3ad1caaa65354b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_13_35_41_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為國瑞路一工地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5a064f2f832c674f632ce7e38b738ddf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_13_35_41.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批消防到場戒備。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81976ca95f4c9eca5d11efd0d0b70e02/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_13_35_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封路作調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fef6d8f57e4241207e9819b0e86b0fff/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_13_35_39_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ee858eceb4cf6878f3df1cdb1860ce4d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_13_35_39.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T05:58:23.964936+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}